<title>UK: Great Portland to sell seven London sites.</title>
<headline>Great Portland to sell seven London sites.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property development group Great Portland Estates Plc said on Thursday it agreed to sell seven properties in central London in May next year for just over 11 million pounds.</p>
<p>Great Portland said the price represented a gain of nearly 10 percent on March 1996 book values.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4107</p>
</text>
